WEBVTT

00:32.112 --> 00:33.488
Hey, you sound cheerful today.

00:37.159 --> 00:38.201
Are you at my place?

00:40.788 --> 00:42.288
I'll finish this, then I'm on my way.

01:23.914 --> 01:27.000
So you are not married.

01:28.252 --> 01:29.293
No.

01:29.294 --> 01:30.336
Lived together?

01:32.297 --> 01:35.216
No, not really.

01:36.969 --> 01:40.805
Never thought of marrying her
in ten years?

01:42.850 --> 01:43.850
Well...

01:45.644 --> 01:47.145
She wanted to pursue her career.

01:49.273 --> 01:50.273
She what?

01:51.900 --> 01:52.900
Are you sure?

01:56.196 --> 01:57.822
But how did she get it?

02:01.702 --> 02:05.121
That's her friend.
I know him.

02:06.999 --> 02:09.500
I didn't know he was associated
with gangsters.

02:11.712 --> 02:13.254
I don't think she knew it.

02:14.631 --> 02:16.340
He may've been in trouble...

02:17.134 --> 02:19.719
...so left it in her care
without telling her what it was.

02:21.472 --> 02:24.891
Drugs?
You mean like cocaine?

02:25.726 --> 02:26.726
Did you find any?

02:27.227 --> 02:29.604
Not really.

02:31.648 --> 02:32.648
I don't know.

02:34.693 --> 02:35.693
No, I don't.

02:37.321 --> 02:38.738
I really don't know.

02:43.952 --> 02:51.952
Why?...

02:58.092 --> 02:59.092
Why commit suicide?

04:11.874 --> 04:15.042
Hello...
Where have you been?

04:15.878 --> 04:18.379
Stop turning off your mobile when you drink

04:19.173 --> 04:21.465
Need to talk about clients
screening tomorrow.

04:50.037 --> 04:51.037
What?

04:52.164 --> 04:53.414
Don't you remember me?

04:54.708 --> 04:58.294
You bit my hand
and left this scar.

05:01.632 --> 05:03.132
You staggered at the platform...

05:03.967 --> 05:08.054
and were almost hit by a train.
So I grabbed you, remember?

05:23.820 --> 05:24.820
Hey.

05:25.739 --> 05:27.114
What was going on then?

05:30.702 --> 05:31.953
What do you want?

05:33.622 --> 05:34.664
Wanna do 'it', or what?

05:36.291 --> 05:38.251
Sex. Don't you know?

05:49.638 --> 05:51.722
Guys, someone wants to have sex with me.

06:04.069 --> 06:05.069
Hi.

06:06.446 --> 06:07.446
Nice to see ya.

06:09.658 --> 06:14.287
Listen up...
I've got an early day tomorrow,

06:15.580 --> 06:18.207
but I've got no time to play
with kids like you.

06:19.084 --> 06:21.919
On top of that, I've got no money, Sonny.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.727
I paid you back.

06:38.562 --> 06:39.562
Paid back.

06:46.069 --> 06:48.154
I think we robbed this guy before.

06:48.655 --> 06:51.282
- Yeah, we sure did.
- We were playing the 'subway game'.

06:52.617 --> 06:53.617
It was Chisato's turn.

06:54.286 --> 06:56.704
He threw us his wallet
and ran away like a dog.

06:57.164 --> 06:58.789
What's it with you today, pop?

07:01.293 --> 07:02.543
Stand up.

07:04.713 --> 07:08.924
Bring your money to our club.

07:09.801 --> 07:12.553
You shouldn't tell him where.

07:13.096 --> 07:15.723
Oh, he means no harm to us.

07:16.767 --> 07:17.933
'Cause he's a chicken shit.

07:22.773 --> 07:27.193
Don't do anything funny,
or you'll be in trouble.

07:28.862 --> 07:30.363
I'm already in deep shit.

07:31.823 --> 07:33.282
Even a worm turns, so to speak

07:34.618 --> 07:36.702
Ain't that right, Chisato?

07:48.215 --> 07:49.215
Kiriko...

07:57.140 --> 07:59.100
how did you get the gun?

08:02.104 --> 08:04.188
How the hell did you get it?

08:17.786 --> 08:18.786
What's so funny?

08:19.121 --> 08:20.830
Our clients looked very satisfied.

08:21.164 --> 08:24.708
My grand daughter's eyes are glued
to the TV whenever...

08:24.709 --> 08:25.918
your commercials are on.

08:26.336 --> 08:29.338
Goda, make yourself available
for next one, will you?

08:29.631 --> 08:30.631
Sure.

08:30.882 --> 08:32.925
- Well, then...
- See you.

08:41.059 --> 08:42.476
He looks better.

08:43.353 --> 08:47.189
Even at the loss of his girlfriend,
he doesn't take even a day off.

08:52.362 --> 08:53.737
- You know...
- Yes?

08:55.699 --> 08:58.367
How does one get a gun here?

08:59.494 --> 09:00.494
What?

09:02.622 --> 09:03.622
Oh that...

09:08.795 --> 09:10.296
"Toy Gun Shop"

09:27.355 --> 09:30.774
Shut your goddamn mouth up.

09:34.988 --> 09:35.988
Sorry!

09:36.656 --> 09:39.074
- Hold it right there.
- Ok.

09:45.207 --> 09:47.791
You got any idea how much a gun costs?

09:48.460 --> 09:49.460
How much?

09:51.546 --> 09:56.884
2 million for a gun and
500,000 yen for 5 bullets.

09:59.137 --> 10:00.846
How much is it all together?

10:01.848 --> 10:02.932
2.5 million yen.

10:04.184 --> 10:05.351
You got that right.

10:07.187 --> 10:09.063
I'll get you the money tomorrow morning.

10:09.648 --> 10:13.275
This is a deposit.

10:15.904 --> 10:16.904
Umm...

10:18.740 --> 10:20.658
You got a 'chief special'?

10:26.248 --> 10:29.083
This is strictly between us.

10:29.918 --> 10:32.545
If you got any problem,
come to me first.

10:32.963 --> 10:35.798
Don't talk with anyone in the syndicate.

11:34.149 --> 11:36.525
How has your son worked out so far?

11:37.110 --> 11:38.152
He's just fine.

11:40.071 --> 11:44.533
He used to be wild and got into fights...

11:45.076 --> 11:46.702
when he was your son's age.

11:47.162 --> 11:50.664
Me?
I don't remember.

11:51.207 --> 11:53.042
You don't say.

11:55.837 --> 11:59.840
But I think no one could've kicked
your ass when you were that age.

12:01.176 --> 12:03.010
I was much younger.

12:05.096 --> 12:06.889
The time was right after World War II.

12:07.265 --> 12:09.850
No training needed then,
it was the way of life.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.061
So much for my past.

12:15.607 --> 12:17.358
You came to see my son?

12:20.278 --> 12:22.863
Come on in.
Shigeo, your friends are here.

12:28.703 --> 12:31.080
Hi. Please take this.

12:32.207 --> 12:34.708
When you gonna rob somebody,
make sure he's weaker.

12:37.003 --> 12:39.046
Thanks for your help then.

12:55.438 --> 12:57.022
'Chief Special'

13:17.085 --> 13:21.171
No, no. I don't have it,
but I've got 'speed' and 'weed'

13:22.132 --> 13:23.173
What's 'speed'?

13:23.174 --> 13:24.174
It's 'shabu'.

13:25.009 --> 13:26.677
You mean methedrine?

13:33.184 --> 13:34.184
Good evening.

14:01.045 --> 14:06.550
Thought you were at work. What's this?

14:25.737 --> 14:29.865
Ringo Kid: Dismantle a gun.
Use tin foil to pass the custom check.

14:30.200 --> 14:34.453
Jun Wayne: Import some parts,
then you can reassemble a gun.

14:34.704 --> 14:40.292
Better Tomorrow: Someone made
a real gun out of an old toy.

14:44.088 --> 14:45.756
You mean illegally made?

15:02.106 --> 15:03.440
Can't give you a receipt.

15:04.234 --> 15:06.902
It's a toy gun, right?
Don't make any trouble for me.

15:09.781 --> 15:11.990
The same size as this?

15:12.367 --> 15:14.993
Yes, the size of a pencil holder.

15:15.286 --> 15:19.748
This, too, the same size,
using this material...

15:19.999 --> 15:20.999
I see.

15:22.085 --> 15:24.711
I want to use it for a long time.
So please make it strong.

18:21.472 --> 18:24.266
Wow, Idei gave us a lot.

18:25.101 --> 18:27.269
Don't be an 'amateur'.

18:27.854 --> 18:30.188
Here is your ticket to heaven.

18:31.024 --> 18:33.859
You should try this, Goto.

19:18.654 --> 19:19.988
I got it, Sugar.

19:20.907 --> 19:22.824
You're stuck with real hard job, Honey.

19:24.243 --> 19:27.454
It ain't a Utopia here.

19:29.248 --> 19:32.834
Forget about ideal.
Then you start to feel better.

20:08.246 --> 20:10.831
You got the money, pop. Good!

20:11.666 --> 20:14.000
Where the hell are they?
Tell me!

20:17.839 --> 20:19.798
I'll break their necks!

21:16.063 --> 21:17.564
What's going on there?

21:35.541 --> 21:36.708
That hurts, man!

22:35.685 --> 22:37.811
Don't make the scene at my club.

22:40.815 --> 22:42.983
Who's this guy?

22:44.318 --> 22:45.443
He's nobody.

22:47.780 --> 22:49.447
Get outta here, jerk!

23:26.110 --> 23:28.111
- Did that jerk scare you?
- Not a chance.

23:29.447 --> 23:30.780
Good girl, good.

23:32.825 --> 23:34.743
How did you get this scar?

23:35.036 --> 23:36.202
I got it recently.

23:36.954 --> 23:38.997
The best I've ever felt.

23:39.457 --> 23:40.582
I threw myself...

23:42.418 --> 23:43.418
into a moving car.

23:46.297 --> 23:47.422
What about this?

23:47.715 --> 23:50.967
That's nothing.
A punk stabbed me with a knife.

23:53.054 --> 23:55.889
Why do you take speed alone?

24:01.228 --> 24:03.313
I don't want anyone to see me...

24:03.689 --> 24:06.066
just like I'm eating or having sex.

24:30.257 --> 24:31.257
You'll die...

25:12.508 --> 25:18.221
'Chisato Will Die at Midnight Tomorrow'

25:26.313 --> 25:28.398
Who the hell cares!

25:40.953 --> 25:43.621
What do you want from me?

25:46.625 --> 25:48.293
What's it about tomorrow?

25:50.796 --> 25:52.714
None of your business.

25:56.135 --> 25:57.677
Tell me what'll happen?

26:07.855 --> 26:11.316
It's a group of punks.
They're pushing us around...

26:14.820 --> 26:16.988
so we'll whack 'em.

26:19.033 --> 26:20.033
Where is it?

26:21.160 --> 26:23.703
You want a day off?

26:25.748 --> 26:27.916
You want me to tell it to our boss?

26:29.335 --> 26:31.711
Are you out of your mind?
Goda... hello...

27:47.079 --> 27:48.079
Hey!

27:49.957 --> 27:50.957
You!

27:53.168 --> 27:54.669
What's going on there?

27:59.550 --> 28:01.467
What's that shitty face for?

28:01.844 --> 28:04.387
Who the hell you think that car belongs to?

28:33.584 --> 28:37.462
Get rid of him fast.
Shit! He's fucking heavy.

28:59.443 --> 29:00.443
Me?

29:01.403 --> 29:02.945
I'll find work like anybody else.

29:03.906 --> 29:05.657
Can't go on like this forever.

29:07.451 --> 29:09.911
I'll go to college
to study science and engineering.

29:13.916 --> 29:15.124
- You know what?
- What?

29:16.418 --> 29:20.963
I'll bring a bat with lots of
nails stuck in as a weapon.

29:22.549 --> 29:23.675
How about yours?

29:24.677 --> 29:25.677
Mine?

29:26.387 --> 29:29.722
My fists will do.
I'll blow 'em away with my punches.

29:38.857 --> 29:41.275
- Hope we can work together.
- I do, too.

29:41.777 --> 29:44.487
I am off this way.
See you.

30:21.608 --> 30:22.608
Listen, Goto.

30:23.444 --> 30:26.863
Teach those punks a real lesson tonight.

30:28.157 --> 30:30.199
Show 'em how serious we are.

30:33.370 --> 30:35.538
You ain't scared, are you?!

30:37.541 --> 30:38.541
Idei...

30:40.544 --> 30:41.836
...I'll kill 'em for sure.

30:45.424 --> 30:47.216
I was told you've got guns!

30:47.217 --> 30:49.260
Give me a break!
No guns here.

30:49.636 --> 30:51.012
Please! Sell one to me!

30:51.430 --> 30:54.724
I want a 'Chief Special'.
I need it!

31:22.544 --> 31:25.797
I've been watching you.

31:28.091 --> 31:31.093
You'll get this if you do me a favour.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.640
Marry me.

31:39.520 --> 31:41.646
I can't go back to my country now.

31:42.064 --> 31:46.567
I need more money to live here.

31:47.945 --> 31:48.945
More and more.

31:49.530 --> 31:54.992
I need a visa to stay here,
so getting married is the answer.

31:56.161 --> 31:57.745
Let me ask you a question.

32:00.791 --> 32:03.000
Was it his gun,
the guy who was killed?

32:05.379 --> 32:07.672
He said to forget him if he died.

32:08.632 --> 32:12.301
That's what I am doing now.

32:16.682 --> 32:19.600
Do I sign and put my stamp here

32:24.773 --> 32:28.150
I can be your 'wife' sometimes.

32:40.247 --> 32:42.290
This is our wedding ceremony.

33:29.588 --> 33:30.588
Kiriko...

35:43.430 --> 35:45.264
There're a lot more punks than us.

35:46.308 --> 35:48.768
We'll manage.
It's a matter of when we hit 'em.

35:49.561 --> 35:53.856
Listen, Goda. You take care of that
tough lookin' guy.

35:54.191 --> 35:55.733
Forget about the rest.

35:56.860 --> 36:00.821
Well, let's see... you and you...

36:45.617 --> 36:50.538
Move your asses now.
You get back in the car.

36:51.206 --> 36:53.791
Hey, get back and stay there.

37:37.586 --> 37:39.587
Meet me at our base!

37:42.507 --> 37:43.883
Meet me there, guys!

37:57.772 --> 38:01.734
I'm coming you, Sucker!
Get ready for my fists.

38:18.752 --> 38:19.960
Here they come!

39:09.010 --> 39:10.344
Take that shortcut!

40:18.621 --> 40:20.289
These guys got no guts.

41:46.751 --> 41:48.085
'CHISATO WILL DIE'

41:49.045 --> 41:50.295
Hold it right there!

42:30.420 --> 42:31.545
Let's see...

42:32.589 --> 42:35.716
So it looks like we got into a gun fight.

42:36.968 --> 42:37.968
In that case...

42:39.012 --> 42:41.722
Carry this guy to my club.

42:44.350 --> 42:47.186
Take this one back to his place.

42:48.188 --> 42:50.814
Chisato and Goto, you do that.

42:56.196 --> 42:58.155
Don't take him to hospital.

43:04.287 --> 43:06.121
Make sure you grab that thing...

43:08.625 --> 43:09.750
on your way out.

43:28.853 --> 43:29.853
Hey...

43:33.107 --> 43:34.608
You wanna die?

43:42.158 --> 43:43.909
Did you send this to Goto?

43:45.119 --> 43:49.122
I've been watching you.
Who did you send it to?

43:57.298 --> 43:59.508
Take it easy on that speed, will you?

44:01.844 --> 44:02.844
I never touch.

44:03.721 --> 44:04.721
What?

44:05.431 --> 44:10.811
That shit.
I've never done it.

44:14.107 --> 44:15.399
What's on your mind?

44:19.404 --> 44:20.988
Don't go too far.

44:23.533 --> 44:24.908
What do you care?

44:47.348 --> 44:51.059
Why are you...
always in the fast lane?

44:52.228 --> 44:53.520
Mind your own business.

44:57.066 --> 45:01.778
My girlfriend...
died here.

45:03.948 --> 45:07.492
Why did she...

45:10.705 --> 45:11.913
kill herself?

45:26.012 --> 45:28.847
All right, sucker! I tell you why.

45:29.849 --> 45:31.767
It was you who killed her.

45:32.810 --> 45:33.894
It's your fault.

45:35.480 --> 45:38.523
You don't know you're such
a selfish bastard!

45:38.941 --> 45:41.485
You care only about yourself and...

45:41.486 --> 45:43.945
will never understand her feelings.

45:44.781 --> 45:46.573
But then again, it's not only you.

45:47.158 --> 45:52.412
I know there're many people
like you in this world.

45:53.039 --> 45:54.748
They all killed her.

46:00.922 --> 46:01.922
Go ahead.

46:07.762 --> 46:08.970
Pull the trigger!

46:25.905 --> 46:26.988
Do it yourself.

47:16.497 --> 47:18.749
No, I didn't mean it.

47:19.709 --> 47:20.792
Like you said...

47:21.878 --> 47:25.130
I am the one who
didn't want to get married

47:25.465 --> 47:28.550
Never mind. It's not your fault.

47:34.515 --> 47:38.351
I've never taken marriage seriously.

47:40.313 --> 47:45.525
I think I've been trying not
to see things that are important to me.

47:47.487 --> 47:52.115
People have kids because they need
a reason to keep living.

47:55.453 --> 47:59.956
Or else I'll get lost just like a kite
in the wind without a string.

48:21.938 --> 48:24.231
This is an answering machine...

48:25.566 --> 48:30.070
...so please leave your
message after the tone.

48:32.031 --> 48:34.199
Goda, it's about the assignments.

48:34.408 --> 48:36.368
I found a director to do the commercials.

49:00.309 --> 49:01.309
Kiriko...

49:03.813 --> 49:06.481
my string...
will break soon.

49:08.609 --> 49:09.609
Let's have...

49:12.113 --> 49:13.113
our own kid.

50:34.987 --> 50:36.655
Give us your money now!

50:37.990 --> 50:39.741
Who do you think you are?

50:41.452 --> 50:42.452
Grab it.

51:08.771 --> 51:11.231
Hey, the whole town knows
what you're doing.

51:13.651 --> 51:14.651
Keep it down...

51:15.277 --> 51:16.277
...will you?

51:16.946 --> 51:23.743
Go out and shoot the bum
under the highway.

51:23.995 --> 51:26.037
That bum stinks.

51:28.457 --> 51:29.457
Do it quietly.

51:36.257 --> 51:40.176
Goto, you go.
Congratulations on your job.

51:43.681 --> 51:46.016
Who you're staring at?
We all know about it.

51:47.059 --> 51:49.310
A business suit will look good on you.

51:50.730 --> 51:53.648
Never mind the bum.
Kill anyone who disgusts you...

51:55.568 --> 51:57.527
and then you can redeem
your honour.

52:01.615 --> 52:04.159
In your dreams,
you kill people but don't get caught.

52:06.162 --> 52:08.246
The whole thing about Tokyo is a dream.

52:09.331 --> 52:10.790
We are all in the fucking dream.

52:21.761 --> 52:25.430
...please leave your
message after the tone.

52:26.515 --> 52:27.515
Hello...

53:05.137 --> 53:06.387
Goto has been standing...

53:08.182 --> 53:12.477
at a place with a gun in his hand
for an hour.

53:15.397 --> 53:19.734
If he gets caught with the gun...

53:21.195 --> 53:22.904
you will never get it again.

53:25.366 --> 53:26.699
You care less now?

53:33.833 --> 53:34.833
No...

53:37.044 --> 53:38.044
...I do care.

53:40.089 --> 53:41.089
I need it for once.

53:58.774 --> 53:59.858
Where is he now?

53:59.859 --> 54:00.817
In front of a police station.

54:00.985 --> 54:02.235
Are you sure about that?

54:03.070 --> 54:04.320
Of course I am.

54:27.845 --> 54:28.845
I'm here now.

54:30.139 --> 54:31.264
He's right there.

54:32.308 --> 54:34.267
Goto was riding his bicycle...

54:34.268 --> 54:35.685
...but that cop thought he stole it

54:36.478 --> 54:38.188
and treated him like a criminal.

54:40.191 --> 54:42.400
The cop is just a dirty-mind
in a uniform.

54:43.152 --> 54:46.613
Goto hates a man in uniform
who looks down on others.

55:22.024 --> 55:23.024
Hey, you!

55:23.651 --> 55:24.651
Hold it right there.

55:26.987 --> 55:27.987
Yes?

55:29.740 --> 55:32.033
There you are again.

55:36.747 --> 55:39.374
That bicycle looks different
to the one you had before.

55:40.251 --> 55:41.501
Where to?

55:46.048 --> 55:47.048
Come over here.

55:48.842 --> 55:50.176
Come here, I said.

55:52.263 --> 55:53.554
You come here.

55:57.059 --> 55:58.434
You say what?

56:09.363 --> 56:10.530
Let see...

56:12.324 --> 56:14.951
You covered the registration number
with paint here.

56:16.328 --> 56:18.204
See? I can't let you go free.

56:20.916 --> 56:22.333
You'd better come with me.

56:23.836 --> 56:26.504
Let's talk somewhere else.

56:29.049 --> 56:34.178
Shut the fuck up. My time is too
precious for a punk like you.

56:35.681 --> 56:36.681
Excuse me...

56:40.519 --> 56:41.519
That punk!

57:53.300 --> 57:54.300
Hello.

59:15.299 --> 59:16.382
Stop this shit.

59:20.053 --> 59:22.180
Give it to me.
That's mine.

59:24.016 --> 59:25.016
No way.

59:30.647 --> 59:31.731
Maybe you'll do.

01:00:07.476 --> 01:00:08.476
Shit!

01:00:15.275 --> 01:00:19.737
I'm in chaos.
It would be easier to give the gun back.

01:00:39.132 --> 01:00:42.677
It takes years of training to turn
one's body into iron like yours.

01:01:04.116 --> 01:01:05.283
Where the hell are you?

01:01:07.953 --> 01:01:09.912
Hey, tell me!

01:01:10.914 --> 01:01:11.914
Hey!

01:02:18.023 --> 01:02:19.065
Gang's fight?

01:02:19.775 --> 01:02:21.359
A boxer was shot to death.

01:02:23.111 --> 01:02:24.111
A boxer!

01:05:52.737 --> 01:05:57.491
Our business has made us a lot of enemies.

01:06:00.078 --> 01:06:01.412
But in this case...

01:06:03.748 --> 01:06:07.209
shooting the boxer
just might be the end of all of us.

01:06:08.628 --> 01:06:14.008
Radar captures our movements
by 0. I seconds and...

01:06:14.593 --> 01:06:18.721
calculates the subsequent moves
up to two years in a row.

01:06:19.848 --> 01:06:22.349
That means we can't fight our destiny.

01:06:48.209 --> 01:06:49.209
The door...

01:06:50.462 --> 01:06:51.587
was open.

01:06:57.552 --> 01:06:58.552
I want to...

01:06:59.554 --> 01:07:00.638
ask you a favour.

01:07:15.612 --> 01:07:17.071
Two of our guys were killed.

01:07:17.489 --> 01:07:19.823
The rest can't step out of the club.

01:07:20.283 --> 01:07:23.494
It's only a matter of time
'till the shooter finds us.

01:07:23.787 --> 01:07:27.331
- Is it too much to ask of you to join
me against the shooter? - I'll do it.

01:08:38.319 --> 01:08:39.319
I'm scared.

01:08:41.531 --> 01:08:43.115
We won't do it then.

01:08:44.200 --> 01:08:45.200
It's not that.

01:08:45.785 --> 01:08:48.912
I am scared 'cause what if I make it?
What's next?

01:11:35.663 --> 01:11:39.082
You don't know what you're doing!

01:11:40.293 --> 01:11:41.418
Why him?!

01:11:41.794 --> 01:11:44.421
Do you really think he'd be any help?

01:11:45.465 --> 01:11:47.883
You gave him the gun!

01:11:49.052 --> 01:11:51.386
He may be the one who killed our friends!

01:11:52.222 --> 01:11:53.722
Do you hear me?!

01:11:53.932 --> 01:11:56.308
Don't worry,
I won't use it on you.

01:12:00.021 --> 01:12:01.396
Let him help us.

01:12:02.690 --> 01:12:04.441
If that's what he wants to do.

01:12:06.986 --> 01:12:08.445
You'd better do what you like.

01:12:09.572 --> 01:12:16.495
We're stuck in an endless game.

01:13:20.310 --> 01:13:21.810
What's wrong with you?!

01:13:57.638 --> 01:14:00.015
Hey, Chisato.

01:14:02.477 --> 01:14:03.602
You'd better take a rest.

01:15:35.653 --> 01:15:36.653
Hey.

01:16:43.721 --> 01:16:46.473
No, mum!
I won't be home for dinner.

01:17:12.583 --> 01:17:13.583
Kids...

01:17:14.794 --> 01:17:16.711
don't play bad games.

01:21:16.160 --> 01:21:17.160
Well...

01:21:23.042 --> 01:21:24.459
let's get outta here.

01:21:51.570 --> 01:21:56.741
So long.

